WEBVTT

00:23.760 --> 00:27.800
[Nanno] What is a human's
greatest driving force?

00:32.600 --> 00:34.600
[tranquil music]

00:38.160 --> 00:43.000
NOSEY CLEANER BITCH
I HOPE YOU SUFFOCATE AND DIE

00:46.840 --> 00:47.840
Power.

00:52.680 --> 00:54.040
[sighs deeply]

01:18.240 --> 01:19.240
Hatred.

01:20.920 --> 01:22.920
[suspenseful music]

01:30.640 --> 01:32.760
[Bam] Today,
I was really angry at the cleaner.

01:35.120 --> 01:37.520
I wrote about her.
I don't know what will happen.

01:38.840 --> 01:42.160
They are only words.
She won't actually die, right?

01:43.800 --> 01:47.000
If anyone finds out, I'm screwed.

01:47.520 --> 01:48.720
I'm fucking scared.

01:48.800 --> 01:50.080
[phone dings]

02:02.440 --> 02:04.240
BAM, ARE YOU FREE TOMORROW MORNING?

02:04.320 --> 02:07.800
CAN YOU LOOK FOR MY SHIRT FOR ME?
I CAN'T FIND IT. I NEED IT.

02:07.880 --> 02:09.479
THANKS. I'M GOING TO BED. GOOD NIGHT.

02:16.400 --> 02:17.840
OKAY, O.

02:22.360 --> 02:23.400
NIGHT NIGHT.

02:41.680 --> 02:43.680
[ominous music]

02:48.040 --> 02:51.080
[Nanno] What actually
drives a human the most?

02:51.160 --> 02:52.160
TODAY, I WAS REALLY ANGRY AT THE CLEANER.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.080
I WROTE ABOUT HER.
I DON'T KNOW WHAT WILL HAPPEN.

02:53.160 --> 02:54.720
THEY ARE ONLY WORDS.
SHE WON'T ACTUALLY DIE, RIGHT?

02:54.800 --> 02:55.920
IF ANYONE FINDS OUT, I'M SCREWED.
I'M FUCKING SCARED.

02:56.000 --> 02:57.200
It's fear.

03:00.000 --> 03:02.000
[theme music]

04:23.760 --> 04:25.920
[breathing heavily]

04:38.000 --> 04:40.000
-Who did this to her?
-I can't believe it.

04:42.640 --> 04:43.840
This is horrible.

04:45.560 --> 04:47.440
[indistinct chatter]

04:47.520 --> 04:50.960
NOSEY CLEANER BITCH
I HOPE YOU SUFFOCATE AND DIE

04:54.360 --> 04:56.720
[indistinct chatter]

04:59.360 --> 05:00.560
Why did she do it?

05:02.360 --> 05:05.120
Why would she do it? It's horrible.

05:05.200 --> 05:06.040
[gasps]

05:10.600 --> 05:12.160
This is just horrible.

05:13.240 --> 05:14.920
Bam, I can't believe she hanged herself.

05:18.240 --> 05:19.760
She suffocated to death.

05:22.920 --> 05:25.720
[sobs]
I don't understand why she killed herself.

05:26.600 --> 05:28.120
Whenever I saw her,

05:28.680 --> 05:30.640
she always seemed fine.

05:31.320 --> 05:32.440
Don't you think?

05:34.400 --> 05:35.240
Mm-hm.

05:36.800 --> 05:38.840
-Maybe it was murder.
-No way.

05:40.400 --> 05:41.360
I'm just saying.

05:42.480 --> 05:44.560
She had young children at home.

05:46.400 --> 05:49.120
Why… Why on earth
would she kill herself, Bam?

05:49.200 --> 05:51.200
[suspenseful music]

05:52.640 --> 05:54.800
[siren blaring]

05:57.440 --> 05:59.400
Her children are still in school.

06:00.520 --> 06:02.600
Yes, they're good kids, too.

06:04.120 --> 06:05.520
Maybe it was murder.

06:08.840 --> 06:10.160
[Good] You killed her, didn't you?

06:13.360 --> 06:14.280
What do you mean?

06:14.760 --> 06:16.240
I saw your writing on the wall.

06:17.440 --> 06:19.280
Do you think it's really enchanted?

06:19.360 --> 06:20.560
[sighs]

06:22.120 --> 06:23.800
[exhales deeply]

06:44.960 --> 06:46.800
[panting]

06:50.240 --> 06:52.240
[tense music]

06:58.280 --> 07:00.720
[sobbing]

07:20.360 --> 07:21.880
[female student 1] How did she survive?

07:21.960 --> 07:23.560
I saw her. She was dead.

07:23.640 --> 07:25.160
[male student 1] Yeah, that was scary.

07:25.240 --> 07:26.800
Jan said she just sat right up.

07:27.360 --> 07:28.760
Hey, how is the cleaner?

07:28.840 --> 07:30.920
It was terrifying.

07:31.000 --> 07:32.120
She didn't die.

07:32.200 --> 07:34.400
She just sat up like nothing happened.

07:35.040 --> 07:36.400
Oh.

07:36.480 --> 07:38.320
-Scary.
-[male student 1] Damn right.

07:44.040 --> 07:45.440
[sighs]

07:51.000 --> 07:51.920
[Nanno sobbing]

07:52.000 --> 07:54.080
-[O] Nanno.
-[Nanno] Yeah?

07:54.160 --> 07:55.160
[O] What is it?

07:55.240 --> 07:57.480
I just saw her yesterday.

07:58.640 --> 07:59.760
[O] Well…

08:00.320 --> 08:03.320
do you, uh, do you think
you can handle class today?

08:03.800 --> 08:04.840
Do you want something to drink?

08:04.920 --> 08:06.280
-I'll get you something. I'll be quick.
-No.

08:06.360 --> 08:08.640
Please don't go. I'm just so scared.
[sobs]

08:08.720 --> 08:11.760
[announcer] All students should avoid
the ground floor corridor.

08:12.640 --> 08:15.200
And there will be no assembly
this morning.

08:16.000 --> 08:17.360
Students, go to your classrooms.

08:17.440 --> 08:19.240
-[O] I can stay here with you.
-[Nanno sobbing]

08:21.000 --> 08:22.800
[crying]

08:31.800 --> 08:34.000
-[Nanno] Oh, no!
-[O] Nanno!

08:37.320 --> 08:38.400
Nanno!

08:39.000 --> 08:40.880
[Nanno] No. No! No!

08:40.960 --> 08:42.440
-[O] Nanno!
-[Nanno] No.

08:42.520 --> 08:43.679
[O panting]

08:43.760 --> 08:45.640
Nanno, what's wrong?

08:46.480 --> 08:48.920
[Nanno] No! What's happening?

08:49.640 --> 08:53.600
ZIT-FACE NANNO

08:54.880 --> 08:55.840
[female teacher 1] Miss…

08:56.720 --> 08:58.440
are you sure you're all right?

08:59.440 --> 09:01.000
If you need to take a break, you can.

09:01.080 --> 09:03.040
May-- Maybe you should take
a couple of months off.

09:05.640 --> 09:07.440
You still… look pale.

09:08.600 --> 09:10.120
Why don't you rest for today?

09:12.440 --> 09:13.480
Just come back tomorrow.

09:19.200 --> 09:21.200
[ominous music]

09:39.040 --> 09:40.240
[key clanks]

10:01.280 --> 10:03.480
SURVIVE HANGING

10:07.200 --> 10:09.200
[suspenseful music]

10:20.040 --> 10:21.760
-[phone rings]
-[gasps]

10:24.840 --> 10:26.720
MOM

10:28.680 --> 10:29.760
Hi, Mom.

10:33.040 --> 10:34.120
Hello?

10:34.880 --> 10:35.960
Mom?

10:37.200 --> 10:38.360
Can you--

10:47.960 --> 10:48.880
[phone rings]

10:48.960 --> 10:51.280
SIS

10:52.560 --> 10:53.600
Hi, sis.

10:53.680 --> 10:54.880
[Mom] Hey.

10:54.960 --> 10:56.680
I'm using your sister's phone.

10:56.760 --> 10:58.680
I couldn't hear you on mine.

10:58.760 --> 10:59.760
[sighs]

11:00.360 --> 11:01.280
Hmm.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.040
What's going on?

11:03.640 --> 11:04.920
[Mom] Nothing.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.520
Can't I just call you?

11:06.600 --> 11:07.600
Of course.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.880
Are you with her?

11:09.960 --> 11:12.200
[Mom] Yes. She stopped by for dinner.

11:13.200 --> 11:14.800
Why the heck did you not invite me?

11:14.880 --> 11:16.640
[Mom] Like you would come if I did.

11:16.720 --> 11:17.920
You wouldn't be interested.

11:18.440 --> 11:19.720
You just called to complain.

11:20.520 --> 11:22.200
[Mom] Well, so what?

11:22.280 --> 11:23.880
Can't I complain just a bit?

11:23.960 --> 11:25.640
I thought it was something important,

11:25.720 --> 11:27.280
but you're just complaining to me.

11:27.360 --> 11:30.360
[Mom] Aren't I allowed to call
my own daughter when I miss her? 

11:32.800 --> 11:33.720
Hmm.

11:34.240 --> 11:35.400
[Mom] Have you had dinner yet?

11:36.200 --> 11:37.160
I did.

11:37.920 --> 11:39.440
[Mom] How is school going?

11:39.520 --> 11:40.720
It's fine.

11:41.760 --> 11:43.560
[Mom] You would tell me
if anything is wrong, right?

11:43.640 --> 11:45.760
I had an ominous dream last night.

11:45.840 --> 11:47.360
I was chasing something.

11:47.440 --> 11:49.960
Then I found you in front of the bathroom.

11:50.040 --> 11:51.240
You walked in there,

11:51.320 --> 11:53.400
and the door shut in my face.

11:55.680 --> 11:56.600
Mm.

11:59.040 --> 11:59.880
[sighs]

12:01.080 --> 12:02.880
-Mom.
-[Mom] Yes?

12:04.680 --> 12:06.600
Do you think the dead
can come back to life?

12:07.160 --> 12:08.640
[Mom] That's a weird question.

12:09.640 --> 12:10.600
Well…

12:12.000 --> 12:14.640
Today, a janitor at school hanged herself.

12:15.520 --> 12:17.280
And then she just woke up.

12:17.360 --> 12:18.920
[Mom] So she didn't really die.

12:19.000 --> 12:21.480
If she had really died,
she would be like your dad.

12:21.560 --> 12:22.560
Dead and gone.

12:22.640 --> 12:24.440
You can't be serious, Mom.

12:24.520 --> 12:26.360
[Mom] I'm totally serious.

12:29.360 --> 12:30.320
And…

12:31.080 --> 12:33.240
do you think a person can turn into a dog?

12:33.320 --> 12:34.200
[Mom] What?

12:36.000 --> 12:37.480
[groans]
Never mind.

12:37.560 --> 12:39.040
You'll just make another joke.

12:40.240 --> 12:41.640
[Mom] Are you annoyed with me?

12:42.480 --> 12:43.640
No.

12:45.320 --> 12:47.040
I have to hang up now. Let's talk later.

13:08.560 --> 13:09.480
[gasps]

13:13.400 --> 13:15.400
[ominous music]

13:22.520 --> 13:24.800
[sobbing]

13:34.960 --> 13:35.920
[gasps]

13:42.600 --> 13:43.440
Nanno.

13:46.200 --> 13:47.160
Bam.

13:49.440 --> 13:50.800
Why the hell did you kill her?

13:52.680 --> 13:55.800
[Nanno] She didn't do anything wrong.
She's a good person.

13:58.640 --> 13:59.800
How did you get in here?

14:01.600 --> 14:03.480
Answer me. Why did you kill her?

14:04.640 --> 14:05.800
She's so good.

14:06.360 --> 14:07.920
She helps everyone.

14:08.680 --> 14:10.160
Why did you kill her?

14:13.120 --> 14:14.680
She's alive, isn't she?

14:16.000 --> 14:17.040
What else do you want?

14:17.120 --> 14:19.240
But, Bam, you just killed somebody.

14:20.480 --> 14:22.240
Bam, you killed someone.

14:23.600 --> 14:24.760
You killed someone.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.360
You killed someone.

14:28.560 --> 14:30.040
You killed someone.

14:30.120 --> 14:31.240
[squeals]

14:35.120 --> 14:37.280
[breathing heavily]

14:52.000 --> 14:54.320
[pants]

14:59.680 --> 15:00.720
[male teacher] Students,

15:00.800 --> 15:04.120
the gravity that makes the apple fall
from the tree

15:04.200 --> 15:06.920
is the same force
that attracts the moon to the Earth,

15:07.000 --> 15:08.800
and pulls all the stars together,

15:08.880 --> 15:12.000
so that they orbit and don't crash
into each other.

15:12.080 --> 15:14.400
-It's really pretty amazing…
-[window opens]

15:16.160 --> 15:17.480
[indistinct chatter]

15:17.560 --> 15:18.400
[female student 2] Oh, my God! Fon!

15:18.480 --> 15:21.040
[indistinct chatter]

15:21.120 --> 15:22.720
-[gasping]
-[student screams]

15:24.480 --> 15:25.640
[male student 2] Oh, my gosh!

15:25.720 --> 15:28.920
-What the fuck?
-[male student 3] Oh, my God!

15:29.000 --> 15:30.600
[male student 4] Go get help! Go!

15:32.200 --> 15:35.920
[indistinct chattering]

15:36.000 --> 15:39.720
[male teacher] Calm down, everyone.
Calm down. Sit down.

15:42.560 --> 15:43.440
[gasps]

15:44.920 --> 15:46.080
[Nanno] Bam.

15:46.160 --> 15:48.600
Thank you so much, I really appreciate it.

15:48.680 --> 15:50.160
I'm glad I took your advice.

16:03.320 --> 16:07.360
GO AND KILL YOURSELF, FON

16:29.720 --> 16:30.720
Nanno.

16:32.240 --> 16:33.240
Where are you going?

16:33.720 --> 16:36.040
I'm just going to the toilet. What is it?

16:37.920 --> 16:38.760
Nothing.

16:39.440 --> 16:40.280
[scoffs]

16:41.680 --> 16:43.480
This is your favorite place, am I right?

16:44.160 --> 16:46.080
I see you coming in here a lot.

16:47.840 --> 16:48.920
No, I don't.

16:49.480 --> 16:50.320
It's just close.

16:50.960 --> 16:52.080
Yeah.

16:52.160 --> 16:54.080
Well, please excuse me.

17:09.599 --> 17:10.480
[door closes]

17:10.560 --> 17:11.560
[toilet seat cover clanks]

17:11.640 --> 17:13.640
[suspenseful music]

17:17.800 --> 17:19.480
[toilet flushing]

17:21.520 --> 17:22.400
[clears throat]

17:32.480 --> 17:34.200
Bam, you're so nice.

17:34.280 --> 17:36.120
You didn't have to wait for me, you know.

17:43.640 --> 17:44.480
[clicks tongue]

17:52.080 --> 17:53.080
[sighs]

17:59.120 --> 18:00.800
[retreating footsteps]

18:04.800 --> 18:06.360
[female student 3] This one. Here.

18:07.280 --> 18:08.360
[door opens]

18:15.520 --> 18:17.480
They said she came in and saw that.

18:17.960 --> 18:21.000
[male student 5] Really? You think so?

18:22.400 --> 18:23.880
Want some?

18:23.960 --> 18:26.000
[laughs]

18:26.080 --> 18:27.040
-You're full?
-What are you doing?

18:27.120 --> 18:28.400
You haven't had your dessert yet.

18:28.480 --> 18:31.640
Fah, are you crazy?
Why are you doing that?

18:31.720 --> 18:33.200
-Fah.
-Put that down.

18:33.840 --> 18:35.520
[humming]

18:35.600 --> 18:36.880
-What's wrong with you?
-Fah.

18:36.960 --> 18:39.120
-Hey.
-[Fah's friend 1] Fah. Fah. Come on.

18:39.200 --> 18:40.800
Give us some room,
we don't know what's happening.

18:40.880 --> 18:42.080
-What's wrong?
-Get down from there.

18:42.160 --> 18:43.800
-[Fah's friend 2] Hey, stop it!
-[Fah's friend 3] Fah!

18:43.880 --> 18:45.440
[Fah's friend 1] Hey, Fah.

18:45.520 --> 18:47.680
-[humming]
-What are you doing? Put it down.

18:47.760 --> 18:49.160
-Come on.
-Fah.

18:49.240 --> 18:51.280
-What's wrong with Fah?
-What's happening to her?

18:51.360 --> 18:53.200
-Fah!
-What's wrong?

18:53.280 --> 18:56.320
[indistinct chattering]

18:56.400 --> 18:58.440
[laughs]

19:01.640 --> 19:02.560
What's wrong with you?

19:03.720 --> 19:05.560
What are you doing? Are you crazy?

19:06.920 --> 19:09.240
FAH, YOU CRAZY BITCH

19:10.120 --> 19:13.320
[crowd] Cherry! Cherry! Cherry! Cherry!

19:13.400 --> 19:15.960
-Cherry! Cherry! Cherry!
-What the-- Get away from me!

19:16.040 --> 19:18.680
-[crowd] Cherry! Cherry! Cherry!
-[squeals]

19:18.760 --> 19:23.920
Cherry! Cherry! Cherry!
Cherry! Cherry! Cherry!

19:24.000 --> 19:27.200
Cherry! Cherry! Cherry!
Cherry! Cherry! Cherry!

19:27.280 --> 19:30.440
CHERRY IS A SLUT

19:30.520 --> 19:32.240
[growling, barking]

19:32.320 --> 19:34.160
[female teacher 2] You will have to be
the school representative

19:34.240 --> 19:36.320
for the upcoming competition, Pichit.

19:36.400 --> 19:37.560
[Top barks]

19:37.640 --> 19:40.480
TOP, YOU DOG BRAIN

19:40.560 --> 19:43.760
[siren blaring]

19:52.240 --> 19:55.520
FAT FUCKING PRINCIPAL
DIES OF CLOGGED ARTERY

19:55.600 --> 19:56.960
[approaching footsteps]

19:58.160 --> 19:59.400
[panting]

20:07.200 --> 20:09.160
Who did you tell about the wall? Everyone?

20:09.240 --> 20:11.320
What's it to you?
Since when do you own the wall?

20:13.160 --> 20:14.880
It's just gone too far.

20:14.960 --> 20:16.760
Can't you see what's happening here?

20:16.840 --> 20:17.800
[Good] So what?

20:18.280 --> 20:20.240
When I was bullied and beaten up

20:20.320 --> 20:23.080
did anyone take care of me
or offer me help?

20:24.360 --> 20:25.560
Not one of them did.

20:27.280 --> 20:28.640
So who cares about them?

20:29.960 --> 20:31.360
You did it to Nanno, didn't you?

20:34.440 --> 20:35.840
Isn't it satisfying now?

20:35.920 --> 20:38.040
When we can make them pay
for what they did to us?

20:40.760 --> 20:41.720
Hey, Bam.

20:42.320 --> 20:43.840
Everyone is grateful to you.

20:58.840 --> 21:00.840
[tense music]

21:12.480 --> 21:13.440
DATA HAS INGROWN NAILS

21:14.000 --> 21:15.720
KAO HAS BAD BREATH

21:15.800 --> 21:17.320
YOU DOG BRAIN

21:17.400 --> 21:19.040
GUY IS A CRAZY FUCKER

21:27.640 --> 21:32.280
O, YOU CRIPPLE

21:32.920 --> 21:34.000
This can't be happening.

21:35.240 --> 21:36.120
Oh, no.

21:47.240 --> 21:48.600
[gasping]

22:02.000 --> 22:03.360
[breathing heavily]

22:09.480 --> 22:10.480
[pants]

22:11.160 --> 22:13.440
O, that's enough for you today.

22:14.680 --> 22:15.640
Please go home now.

22:15.720 --> 22:17.680
I-- I haven't even been
on the field yet today.

22:18.240 --> 22:19.880
My shirt still smells like Nanno.

22:20.760 --> 22:21.800
O.

22:22.360 --> 22:24.360
Please, for me, just go home.

22:24.440 --> 22:25.920
-The guys--
-Bam, what the hell?

22:26.000 --> 22:27.200
[Bam] O, just go home.

22:27.280 --> 22:28.720
-And what's wrong?
-Please, O.

22:28.800 --> 22:30.280
-Just go home.
-Hey, let go of me!

22:30.360 --> 22:32.440
-O!
-[O groans]

22:32.520 --> 22:34.000
-Fuck.
-O!

22:34.080 --> 22:36.720
[groans]
God!

22:36.800 --> 22:38.880
-O.
-[Por] Are you okay?

22:38.960 --> 22:40.640
-[Teng] O.
-[O] Damn it.

22:40.720 --> 22:42.320
-[Teng] What's wrong?
-[Por] Get off him.

22:42.400 --> 22:43.760
-Are you all right?
-O!

22:43.840 --> 22:45.320
[Teng] Don't touch his legs. To the left.

22:45.400 --> 22:47.360
All right, sit down. Take it easy.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.840
-[teammate 1] Can you move it?
-[Teng] We got you.

22:49.920 --> 22:51.880
-[O] Shit! Oh, my ankle.
-[Teng] We got you.

22:51.960 --> 22:53.280
[Por] No, no, no.
Just a second. Be patient.

22:53.360 --> 22:54.600
-Don't worry. We've got you.
-[O groaning]

22:54.680 --> 22:56.640
-[Teng] Just hold on.
-[teammate 1] Careful.

22:57.280 --> 22:58.680
-[O] Fuck.
-[Teng] Come on, come on.

22:58.760 --> 23:00.160
[O groaning]

23:00.960 --> 23:02.040
What the fuck?

23:02.120 --> 23:03.160
Why did you do that?

23:04.200 --> 23:05.120
What did I do?

23:05.200 --> 23:06.160
Clean it off right now.

23:06.240 --> 23:07.360
What the fuck is your problem?

23:07.440 --> 23:09.440
-You come with me and clean it off.
-Clean what?

23:09.520 --> 23:10.440
What's wrong with you?

23:10.520 --> 23:12.480
Can't you see what's happening?
He needs to go to the hospital.

23:12.560 --> 23:13.480
-Come on!
-Get lost!

23:13.560 --> 23:14.960
-Calm down, Por. Come and help.
-Fuck.

23:15.040 --> 23:16.440
Okay, up, up, up.

23:17.000 --> 23:18.680
-[O screams]
-[teammate 1] Sorry.

23:18.760 --> 23:20.760
[teammate 2] Slowly. Come on.
Come on. Let's go slowly.

23:21.440 --> 23:24.040
[Teng] Let's go. Let's go.
Take it easy. Guys, come on.

23:24.640 --> 23:25.960
-Wait, wait.
-Get his arm.

23:26.040 --> 23:27.480
-Okay. One, two, three.
-Come on.

23:27.560 --> 23:28.440
Careful, man.

23:28.520 --> 23:30.400
-Oh, God! Holy shit.
-Okay, here we go.

23:33.320 --> 23:35.320
[suspenseful music]

23:42.680 --> 23:45.280
[panting]

24:01.480 --> 24:06.400
ANYONE WHO CLEANS THIS WALL WILL DIE

24:30.120 --> 24:31.200
[male student 6] Hurry up.

24:34.000 --> 24:36.040
-[male student 7] Here it is.
-[male student 6] This?

24:36.120 --> 24:37.120
Give me the pen.

24:44.080 --> 24:46.080
[somber music]

25:28.800 --> 25:29.720
[sobs]

25:38.160 --> 25:39.040
Bam.

25:39.560 --> 25:40.600
Tell me what's wrong.

25:44.960 --> 25:45.840
[sighs deeply]

25:47.320 --> 25:48.480
I'm so sorry, Nanno.

25:50.560 --> 25:51.760
Why are you sorry?

25:54.800 --> 25:55.760
It's my fault.

25:57.200 --> 25:58.680
It's all because of me.

26:01.160 --> 26:02.680
Even your acne is my fault.

26:04.160 --> 26:05.360
I'm so sorry.

26:07.160 --> 26:08.520
[snickers]

26:12.240 --> 26:15.280
[laughing]

26:18.600 --> 26:19.480
Why are you laughing?

26:21.200 --> 26:22.480
Didn't it feel good?

26:25.040 --> 26:27.280
When you made my face stink?

26:28.040 --> 26:29.520
You were so happy about it.

26:30.920 --> 26:32.520
And when you turned Teng into a dog?

26:34.240 --> 26:35.800
When you have all the power…

26:36.680 --> 26:38.320
it's all fun and games, right?

26:39.560 --> 26:41.480
You can write anything about anybody.

26:45.520 --> 26:46.720
Who the hell are you?

26:48.720 --> 26:50.280
Why don't you look around you, Bam?

26:51.640 --> 26:53.720
All the people who wrote on the wall

26:54.600 --> 26:56.240
are normally such good people.

26:58.800 --> 27:00.120
[Nanno] So, what exactly

27:00.920 --> 27:02.880
was it that made them like this?

27:05.400 --> 27:06.880
Do you know, there's no such thing

27:08.280 --> 27:09.640
as a weak person?

27:09.720 --> 27:12.440
ANYONE WHO CLEANS THIS WALL WILL DIE

27:14.160 --> 27:15.040
You.

27:15.640 --> 27:16.880
Why the hell are you doing this?

27:16.960 --> 27:18.320
Who? Me?

27:19.160 --> 27:20.200
I did this?

27:20.960 --> 27:22.240
Bam, think again.

27:22.960 --> 27:24.320
[Nanno] I didn't do anything.

27:24.840 --> 27:25.960
That wall in there

27:26.600 --> 27:28.480
I never wrote on it once.

27:29.840 --> 27:32.520
So, tell me then, who started this?

27:33.840 --> 27:34.920
You tell me

27:35.600 --> 27:38.760
who spread this disease
all over the school.

27:40.200 --> 27:42.000
What about O limping over there,

27:42.080 --> 27:43.520
unable to play soccer?

27:44.160 --> 27:45.160
Who's to blame?

27:46.440 --> 27:48.160
-You.
-Bam.

27:48.720 --> 27:49.560
[grunts]

27:56.440 --> 27:59.200
You know that hurting me
won't solve anything.

28:00.040 --> 28:02.080
You know exactly what you have to do.

28:02.640 --> 28:04.000
You just don't have the guts.

28:04.720 --> 28:05.760
And why not?

28:06.320 --> 28:07.400
Why don't you wanna die?

28:08.240 --> 28:09.760
You already killed someone once.

28:10.280 --> 28:13.800
-Nanno, you fucking bitch.
-[chuckles]

28:13.880 --> 28:15.560
Stop it right now.
I'd shut you up for good

28:15.640 --> 28:17.240
if I have the chance.

28:18.560 --> 28:19.640
But you can.

28:20.360 --> 28:21.360
Ta-da!

28:22.120 --> 28:23.360
A pen.

28:23.440 --> 28:24.360
Take it.

28:24.840 --> 28:26.360
Go ahead and write on your wall.

28:28.880 --> 28:32.040
[tongue clicking]

28:35.000 --> 28:37.160
Don't pretend to be so innocent.

28:37.240 --> 28:38.920
Come on, let it all out.

28:39.000 --> 28:40.840
Write whatever you want on your wall.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.520
I'm sure nothing bad will happen.

28:44.280 --> 28:45.760
So just let it all out.

28:45.840 --> 28:46.920
No!

28:48.800 --> 28:49.720
No.

28:53.240 --> 28:54.320
[sighs]

28:57.080 --> 28:58.480
Just admit it.

28:59.520 --> 29:00.880
You don't have the guts

29:01.680 --> 29:04.320
to take responsibility
for what you started.

29:04.400 --> 29:06.640
[laughs]

29:09.360 --> 29:10.400
Just watch me.

29:13.040 --> 29:13.880
[Nanno sighs]

29:16.040 --> 29:17.440
Hey, everyone.

29:17.520 --> 29:19.760
Bam is gonna clean the wall.

29:22.680 --> 29:25.280
[siren blaring]

29:36.960 --> 29:38.360
[all] Bam!

29:47.720 --> 29:50.200
-[male student 8] Hey!
-[male student 9] Hey, Bam!

29:50.280 --> 29:52.040
-There!
-[male student 8] Hey!

29:53.200 --> 29:54.560
-Stop!
-[male student 9] Bam!

29:54.640 --> 29:56.240
[crowd] Hey, hey, hey!

29:57.760 --> 29:59.200
Come on! Hey!

30:01.040 --> 30:02.560
[female student 4] Bam, don't do that!

30:03.320 --> 30:04.600
Bam!

30:04.680 --> 30:06.560
-[male student 10] Bam!
-[female student 5] No!

30:06.640 --> 30:10.680
[indistinct chattering]

30:10.760 --> 30:13.040
[whimpering]

30:13.120 --> 30:14.640
Open the door!

30:15.160 --> 30:16.640
Bam, open the door!

30:16.720 --> 30:18.120
Why won't it come off?

30:18.200 --> 30:19.240
[Por] Open up!

30:19.720 --> 30:21.560
[Por] What's wrong with you? Bam, open up.

30:21.640 --> 30:22.880
[banging]

30:23.440 --> 30:24.640
Oh!

30:24.720 --> 30:26.200
[students] Open the door!

30:26.280 --> 30:27.240
[Por] Open up, Bam.

30:28.560 --> 30:30.880
[indistinct shouting]

30:32.880 --> 30:36.480
[Por] Open the door! Open this door!

30:37.800 --> 30:39.920
What the fuck, Bam? Open up.

30:42.240 --> 30:43.320
Come on!

30:45.320 --> 30:47.880
What's wrong with you? Open the door.

30:50.040 --> 30:51.040
[shouting stopped]

30:51.120 --> 30:53.480
[breathing heavily]

31:58.080 --> 31:59.600
[Bam] Is anyone there?

33:08.800 --> 33:10.800
[panting]

33:41.440 --> 33:43.440
[somber music]

34:02.720 --> 34:04.640
[sobbing]

34:11.360 --> 34:12.800
Everyone!

34:14.120 --> 34:15.480
Where is everyone?

34:17.800 --> 34:19.040
Hello?

34:20.080 --> 34:20.960
O!

34:22.719 --> 34:23.880
Hey!

34:27.880 --> 34:28.880
[sobs]

34:28.960 --> 34:33.360
I WISH EVERYONE WILL DISAPPEAR

34:33.440 --> 34:34.400
[Bam] O?

34:36.000 --> 34:37.000
Everyone?

34:38.360 --> 34:40.120
[Bam sobbing]

35:42.960 --> 35:46.280
BYE, STUPID. MOM SAYS SORRY
FOR NOT SEEING YOU. SIS.

35:57.560 --> 35:59.640
NO CONTACTS

36:13.800 --> 36:15.960
[sobbing]

36:37.880 --> 36:39.720
[inaudible]

36:43.360 --> 36:44.840
[inaudible]

36:57.440 --> 37:03.880
I WISH EVERYONE WILL DISAPPEAR

37:17.640 --> 37:19.640
[closing theme music]

37:19.720 --> 37:21.720
Subtitle translation by
Mingchut Anuwatnonthaket
